"entity": {
"name": "naturenergie holding AG",
"description": "naturenergie holding AG engages in the production, sale, and distribution of green electricity from hydropower. The firm also provides services in the fields of energy and environment. It operates through the following segments: Germany, New Business Units, and Switzerland. The Germany segment comprises the generation, management, distribution, and sale of electricity within Germany. The New Business Units segment focuses on heating, e-mobility, and photovoltaics. The Switzerland segment specializes in the generation, management, distribution, and sale of electricity in Switzerland. The company was founded in 1908 and is headquartered in Laufenburg, Switzerland.",
